| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
+---------------+---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Sort: sender_info.SenderSid ASC NULLS LAST, fetch=1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |   Projection: sender_info.AccountSid, sender_info.NumberPoolSid, sender_info.SenderSid, sender_info.SenderIdentity, sender_info.Region, sender_info.Rate, sender_info.SenderType, sender_info.LastUsed, sender_info.DateCreated, sender_info.DateUpdated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |     TableScan: sender_info projection=[AccountSid, NumberPoolSid, SenderSid, SenderIdentity, Region, Rate, SenderType, DateCreated, DateUpdated, LastUsed], full_filters=[sender_info.AccountSid = LargeUtf8("AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066"), sender_info.NumberPoolSid = LargeUtf8("NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9"), sender_info.SenderType = LargeUtf8("shortcode"), sender_info.Region = LargeUtf8("US")]                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
| physical_plan | SortExec: TopK(fetch=1), expr=[SenderSid@2 ASC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |   ProjectionExec: expr=[AccountSid@0 as AccountSid, NumberPoolSid@1 as NumberPoolSid, SenderSid@2 as SenderSid, SenderIdentity@3 as SenderIdentity, Region@4 as Region, Rate@5 as Rate, SenderType@6 as SenderType, LastUsed@9 as LastUsed, DateCreated@7 as DateCreated, DateUpdated@8 as DateUpdated]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |     SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |         BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |           DuckSqlExec sql=WITH _intermediate_materialize AS MATERIALIZED (SELECT "AccountSid", "DateCreated", "DateUpdated", "LastUsed", "NumberPoolSid", "Rate", "Region", "SenderIdentity", "SenderSid", "SenderType" FROM "expr0=25/sender_info" WHERE "AccountSid" = 'AC8ee2a82cf11c7c8860b192678c9e3066' AND "NumberPoolSid" = 'NPe85ca269e9eb6b9268ffeab9d6ffaba9') SELECT "AccountSid", "NumberPoolSid", "SenderSid", "SenderIdentity", "Region", "Rate", "SenderType", "DateCreated", "DateUpdated", "LastUsed" FROM _intermediate_materialize WHERE (true) AND (true) AND ("SenderType" = 'shortcode') AND ("Region" = 'US') |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
